  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Development Coexistence Nexus to Address Rohingya Response in Cox&apos;s Bazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;After seven years with no clear repatriation timeframe, declining international funding, and changing needs of the Rohingya population in Bangladesh, it&apos;s crucial to optimise resources.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The proposed project aims to transition from a short-term emergency response to a sustainable mid-term nexus approach that integrates humanitarian, development, and coexistence efforts. This approach will priorities efficiency, community participation, and cost-effectiveness while ensuring quality services.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
